     "text": "```json\n{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"Blocking ciRunner:execution cuts ssoLogin:authenticate, since that AND step needs both ciRunner:execution and kerberoast:credentialAccess. Losing ssoLogin:authenticate removes serviceAccount:privilegeEscalation (an AND that needs ssoLogin), which kills both dbReplica:collection and codeRepo:collection. It also removes fileServer:lateralMovement, whose only parent is ssoLogin. Without fileServer, secretsManager:privilegeEscalation (an AND) fails, so vaultRead:collection fails. shareMount:collection depends only on backupHost:lateralMovement, which is blocked. All four parents of crownData:exfiltrate are therefore unreachable, so the target cannot be reached.\"}\n```"
